        ],
        "notes": "Synchronous ordinary functions are generated JsFunctionObject instances with ordinary property/descriptor, own-key, spread, prototype mutation, extensibility/freeze, JSON omission, identity, typeof, and instanceof behavior. Function.prototype operations and proxy call/construct traps route every callable family through centralized operations."
      },
