        "notes": "The intrinsic constructor objects associated with async functions, generator functions, and async generator functions are exposed as first-class function values with the covered test262 length/extensibility/prototype surface. Full dynamic construction, subclassing, and the remaining advanced constructor scenarios are still tracked separately."
      },
      {
